Create a `src/fetch.ts` exporting a default `fetch` handler. Instantiate `FetchState`, call `sessions(state)` early, then compose `middleware(state, (s) => pages(s))` to run middleware and render pages. Wrap the render callback with `cache(state, () => pages(state))` for cache control. Finally, pass the response through `i18n(state, response)` for locale redirects/fallbacks.

```ts
import { FetchState, cache, i18n, middleware, pages, sessions } from "astro/fetch";

export default {
  async fetch(request: Request): Promise<Response> {
    const state = new FetchState(request);
    await sessions(state);
    const response = await middleware(state, (s) => cache(s, () => pages(s)));
    return i18n(state, response);
  },
};
```

